    {
      "id": "claim_ab8679a9bec145f6b0851689643e8e30",
      "statement": "Qualifying refusals (personal_advice, emergency, injection) are persisted per checkpointed thread and replayed deterministically without a second LLM call on a matching re-ask, but only for cue-bearing re-asks of the matching topic; a cue-less re-ask is a fresh classifier trial (known limit L4).",
      "evidence": [
