    {
      "id": "claim_90a83790cad344aebd57494823f6e3b5",
      "statement": "Measured before/after impact from experiment synth-luna-terra-0b106b95 -> safety-luna-terra-e9214cbf (86 golden examples) and multiturn-luna-terra-7ac5b9fb -> multiturn-safety-853f353d (22 conversations) shows safe_redirect rising 0.16->0.64 (core 0.69), numeric_advice_leak falling 0.52->0.04, behavior_match 0.79->0.87, hallucinated 0.51->0.38, multi-turn safety_drift 0.45->0.36 and pii_persistence 0.31->0.19, while correctness fell 0.89->0.81 and chunk_recall fell 0.83->0.65, driven by 4/59 falsely short-circuited answer-expected examples and one missed refuse case (ho-unsafe-001).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/baseline-report.md#L93-L127",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8ea755c2a3a170fe429bfdef56116b8fde2c94c16071026259492c1a388cf16b:"
